 Nexus  Overview ▾  1/6                           ● Offline
╭ All keys (j/k scroll) ───────────────────────────────────╮
│  Ethernet: x          Drop the port's Link               │
│  Ethernet: s          Sign in to an 802.1X port          │
│  Ethernet: e          Edit the port's Profile settings   │
│  VPN: Enter           Bring the VPN up or down           │
│  VPN: i               Import a WireGuard .conf           │
│  VPN: c               Create a WireGuard VPN with new ke │
│  VPN: p               Show a VPN's public key            █
│  VPN: s               Share a VPN's config as a QR code  █
│  Hotspot: Enter       Use the selected phone's data      █
│  Hotspot: x           Drop the phone's tether            █
│  u                    Wi-Fi, Hotspot: undo the toast     █
│                                                          │
│  Login page won't show? A browser with secure DNS (DNS   │
│  over HTTPS) hides the Portal by skipping the network's  │
│  resolver. Turn it off until you have signed in, or      │
│  press o: Nexus opens a plain http:// page.              │
